<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-2719] Value is not copied in entry processor if optimized marshaller is used</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-2719</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;If &lt;tt&gt;OptimizedMarshaller&lt;/tt&gt; is used, the &lt;tt&gt;MutableEntry&lt;/tt&gt; passed to entry processor contains the same instance that is stored in cache, even if &lt;tt&gt;copyOnRead&lt;/tt&gt; flag is true.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This happens because &lt;tt&gt;CacheLazyEntry.getValue()&lt;/tt&gt; method never creates a copy.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test attached.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
